{"resourceIdentifier":"4279","resourceName":"Monsoon Methane Avoidance from Industrial Wastewater in Malaysia Grouped Project","description":"The Grouped Project will implement biogas recovery, flaring and/or utilization systems for industrial wastewater treatment in Malaysia. The Grouped Project will reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions from industrial facilities by capturing biogas generated in open wastewater treatment systems instead of allowing biogas to escape to the atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe first Project Activity Instance (PAI1) is the Langkap Biogas Plant, implemented at Langkap, in the State of Perak, Malaysia, about 80km south from the city of Perak and 150km north of Kuala Lumpur. PAI1 will treat wastewater from a palm oil mill, by installing a biogas digester system within the existing wastewater treatment system at the mill. It will also treat the biogas and use it to generate electricity for supply to the national electricity grid.","location":{"latitude":4.055500,"longitude":101.138900},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-04-12","endExclusive":"2023-05-13","endInclusive":"2023-05-12"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4279"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Perak"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Monsoon Carbon Pte Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Singapore"},{"type":"string","value":"amcewin@monsooncarbon.com"},{"type":"string","value":"www.monsooncarbon.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4279"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"32423"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.H."}]